    "summary": "Speculators' increased 5-year Treasury shorts may signal expectations of rising interest rates, impacting borrowing costs and economic growth.\nThe post CFTC data shows speculators pile into 5-year Treasury shorts for week of November 3, 2026 appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
